    {
      "id": "b014",
      "chapter": "s3",
      "kind": "narration",
      "display": {
        "en": "Which is bigger, one half or one fourth? Think about the pizza. If you cut it into two slices, each slice is big. If you cut it into four slices, each slice is smaller. So one half is bigger than one fourth. When the denominator gets bigger, each piece gets smaller."
      },
      "spoken": {
        "en": "Which is bigger, one half or one fourth? Think about the pizza. If you cut it into two slices, each slice is big. If you cut it into four slices, each slice is smaller. So one half is bigger than one fourth. When the denominator gets bigger, each piece gets smaller."
      },
